{"3114760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cactiverse", "steam_appid": 3114760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Welcome to <strong>Cactiverse</strong> where cactus-growing meets dragon-flying in a bizarrely epic mashup! Start with a tiny cactus and water it every four hours. Add more cacti, and the watering schedule speeds up, getting you drops faster! Who knew cacti could be this exciting?<br><br>But wait, there’s more! Transform into a dragon, blast targets with waterballs, and soar through hoops in a race against time. Show off your skills, rack up high scores, and dominate the leaderboards to win amazing drops!<br><br>Whether you're a plant enthusiast, a flying ace, or just in it for the giggles, <strong>Cactiverse</strong> is here to keep you entertained!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2>🌵 <strong>Turbo Planting:</strong> More cacti = faster drops! Keep that watering can handy! <br>🌊 <strong>Waterball Frenzy:</strong> Fly as a dragon and blast everything in sight! <br>🎯 <strong>Hoop Dash:</strong> Navigate through hoops and set record-breaking times! <br>🏆 <strong>Leaderboards and Rewards:</strong> Climb the ranks, collect awesome drops, and prove your skills!<br><br>Get ready for a game like no other—grow, fly, and become the ultimate champion in <strong>Cactiverse</strong>!", "about_the_game": "Welcome to <strong>Cactiverse</strong> where cactus-growing meets dragon-flying in a bizarrely epic mashup! Start with a tiny cactus and water it every four hours. Add more cacti, and the watering schedule speeds up, getting you drops faster! Who knew cacti could be this exciting?<br><br>But wait, there’s more! Transform into a dragon, blast targets with waterballs, and soar through hoops in a race against time. Show off your skills, rack up high scores, and dominate the leaderboards to win amazing drops!<br><br>Whether you're a plant enthusiast, a flying ace, or just in it for the giggles, <strong>Cactiverse</str